00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:31.610
sit if something goes wrong.

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:34.790
And the placeholder will
have some debugging steps

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:36.450
if you need some help.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:39.380
But what it's doing
now is, after it's

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:41.660
